    "## TF-IDF Baseline with Cosine Similarity\n",
    "\n",
    "This baseline uses **Term Frequency–Inverse Document Frequency (TF-IDF)** to represent the textual content of the questions and answer options as numerical vectors. The TF-IDF vectorizer is trained on the combined text from the prompt and all five answer options to build a vocabulary of important terms.\n",
